      ],
      "content": "1. 859                                          HIGH STREET                                              (South Side)                                              Nos 1()3 to 1()) (odd)                                              (Formerly listed as                                              NOB 81, 83, 85 & 87) SP 9907 NW 1/22    29.7.50.                II 2. Early C19 terrace of houses of restrained design, dignified proportions. Yellow brick houses with wide eaves to hipped Welsh slated roof.  3 storeys, 8 sashes with glazing bars in reveals under flat arches.  Long narrow 1st floor windows, each with cast iron anthemion design railings to balony. Central segmentally arched passageway. Listing NGR: SP9942607683"
